OL,3,GNEWSALidl signs get Welsh translation -
OL,4,Ain Nottingham
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupermarket chain Lidl has replaced car
OL,7,Fpark signs wrongly installed at a store
OL,8,Fin Nottingham that featured text in
OL,9,FEnglish and Welsh.
OL,11,FConfused shoppers noticed the signs at
OL,12,Fthe Carlton Road store after they
OL,13,Fappeared following routine maintenance
OL,14,Fearlier this year.
OL,16,FThey have now been replaced with
OL,17,FEnglish-only versions, as originally
OL,18,Fintended.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
