OL,3,GNEWSALidl signs get Welsh translation -
OL,4,Ain Nottingham
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Wales, public sector businesses and
OL,7,Forganisations are required by law to
OL,8,Fhave bilingual signage in Welsh and
OL,9,FEnglish, with private businesses
OL,10,Fencouraged to follow suit.
